# Caviar design rules

UI is **Vite + React + Tailwind CSS v4 + the full shadcn/ui set** in `web/`. Theme via CSS variables in `web/src/index.css`. Do not go back to hand-rolled “Tailwind-like” CSS as the source of truth.

Deploy as static GitHub Pages at the repo root for `caviarstudio.sk`:

- Build with `cd web && npm run build:pages` (writes `index.html` + `assets/` to repo root as fallback)
- `.github/workflows/pages.yml` deploys `web/dist` when Pages source is **GitHub Actions** (the owner must switch that in Settings → Pages; agents cannot)
- Keep `CNAME`, `robots.txt`, `sitemap.xml`, SEO tags, JSON-LD

## References

- Repo skills: `.agents/skills/tailwind-design-system`, `.agents/skills/shadcn`, `.agents/skills/web-artifacts-builder`, `.agents/skills/vercel-react-best-practices`, `.agents/skills/frontend-slides`
- `web-artifacts-builder`: React + Vite + Tailwind + shadcn. Apply its anti-slop rules (no Inter, no purple gradients, no excessive centering, no uniform large rounding). Do not re-init with `init-artifact.sh` or Parcel-bundle to one HTML file — this repo deploys via Vite to GitHub Pages.
- `vercel-react-best-practices`: apply SPA React performance rules (passive listeners, lazy state, refs for cursor motion, direct UI imports, versioned lang storage). Skip Next.js/RSC-only guidance.
- Inventory: `SKILLS.md`. Language switch: React `<ViewTransition>` + `startTransition`, honor `prefers-reduced-motion`. Humanize SK/EN/DE copy; no invented facts or stock photos. Three.js: lazy silver/pearl hero shader only, with a CSS silver field on mobile and reduced motion. Live websites sit in the Weby expander (`web/src/lib/work.ts`, screenshot + live href). Photo/video example arrays stay empty until media is added. Do not use WordPress, Expo, or Remotion on this static Pages site.
- `frontend-slides`: use its cinematic stagger, silver atmosphere (grid, hairline chrome), and reduced-motion rules on page sections. Do **not** convert the marketing site into a fixed 1920×1080 slide deck, and do not copy mustard/gold template palettes. Lemon is a small Caviar accent, not a deck fill.
- [Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com/) — spacing, type, color, responsive, dark, animation utilities
- [shadcn/ui components](https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/components) and [blocks](https://ui.shadcn.com/blocks)

## Palette

- Near-black ground `#070708`, elevated `#0E0E12`, surface `#14141A`
- Pearl `#F4F5F7`, silver `#C5CAD3`, platinum `#E8EAEE`, steel `#9AA3AE`
- **Azure `#3D8AFF` main accent**, azure-deep `#1D4ED8` CTA fills, **lemon `#FFE44D` secondary** (small moments only). Not metallic gold, not mustard.
- Menus: `.glass` / `.glass-panel` (blur + saturate, `-webkit-backdrop-filter`, solid fallback). Fixed glass nav overlays the hero so the loop shows through.
- `--radius`: 1.5rem. Cards `rounded-3xl`, buttons `rounded-full`, inputs `rounded-2xl`, icon discs circles. Translucent white/azure borders (~8–15% alpha). Keep WCAG AA.
- Logo: upright Bodoni **CAVIAR** (weight 500, tracking 0.12em, silver gradient) + hairline + **STUDIO · TRNAVA**. No pearl, no italic. Lucide icons in circular `.glass` discs; no gradient dashes. Section kickers: tracked uppercase azure + 6px azure dot (not a faded silver dash).

## Layout

- Generous whitespace. Panels never touch (`gap-6` / `md:gap-8` / `xl:gap-10`). Visible address is Trnava only.
- Slovak default, EN/DE in lockstep. No invented testimonials or numbers.
- Prices 49 / 69 / 190 / 349 EUR s DPH. Contacts unchanged.
- Follow `AGENTS.md` and `.agents/product-marketing.md`. Distinctive silver gallery, not a SaaS kit. No process / Postup section. Page order: Čo robíme, Cenník, Kontakt, Tím, FAQ. Quote CTA on hero, pricing cards, header, and form — not a second button under the price notes. Keep title/meta/OG/JSON-LD/sitemap/robots accurate. No programmatic city pages.
